    {
      "text_id": 867,
      "text": "I am feeling anxious and also have a headache . I am prepping for a procedure tomorrow which is making me nervous but is also frustrating and i am hungry because I\u2019m supposed to be on a liquid diet and all I want to do is eat something .",
      "timestamp": "2022-04-27T20:35:00",
      "order": 47,
      "valence": -2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 868,
      "text": "I am feeling tired and sleepy . I Had a procedure done today , so I\u2019m at home resting and can\u2019t stop sleeping . Tired , worn out , lethargic , lazy . Why does this force me to write so much for my answer \u2026 . I don\u2019t have enough to report lol",
      "timestamp": "2022-04-28T15:19:00",
      "order": 48,
      "valence": -2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 869,
      "text": "Feeling pretty good and refreshed after my weekend and heading into work today . Hoping that the ORG draft being in town will be lucrative this weekend for me , but hopefully nothing too crazy ! Lol \\nFeeling calm mellow ready to work !",
      "timestamp": "2022-04-29T15:01:00",
      "order": 49,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 870,
      "text": "Just relaxing with our dogs and my boyfriend before I go to work later . Feeling mellow and relaxed , happy to have time with my boyfriend and the dogs before work which will likely be hectic and crazy .",
      "timestamp": "2022-04-30T10:03:00",
      "order": 50,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 871,
      "text": "Just got to work , feeling quiet calm mellow , trying to chill for a few minutes before i start my shift . Anxious because I realized my health card is expiring next month and the health department is still backed up so the soonest appointment I can make isn\u2019t until august which is stressing me out .",
      "timestamp": "2022-04-30T15:24:00",
      "order": 51,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 872,
      "text": "Feeling very foggy and tired today . Yesterday was a long night at work , not busy just exhausting . Plus the puppy woke me up a lot last night , and I had a pretty good gym session this morning too so I am feeling pooped today ! But gonna pull myself together for another night at work !",
      "timestamp": "2022-05-01T15:04:00",
      "order": 52,
      "valence": -1.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 873,
      "text": "Just working , getting kinda annoyed with all of the requests to fill out these surveys , multiple times a day , especially when I\u2019m at work . Blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah",
      "timestamp": "2022-05-01T21:23:00",
      "order": 53,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 874,
      "text": "Happy that it\u2019s my weekend . Was a long and slow week at work , had a couple of interesting characters come into the bar this week so that was fun . Just running errands and doing chores today , mellow calm content , happy to be off .",
      "timestamp": "2022-05-03T11:09:00",
      "order": 54,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 875,
      "text": "Bored at work . Very slow and not alot going on . Very strange week . Bored bored bored bored bored bored bored bored bored boring boring boring boring boring boring boring boring boring boring boring boring boring",
      "timestamp": "2022-05-03T20:45:00",
      "order": 55,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 876,
      "text": "It\u2019s my weekend and just running errands and enjoying my days off from work . Feeling productive and calm , happy to spend time with my boyfriend and our four dogs . That is all . Blah blah blah blah blah",
      "timestamp": "2022-05-04T10:47:00",
      "order": 56,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 877,
      "text": "Just relaxing at home after running errands . Enjoying my day offf with the dogs and just chillin at home . Kahfmgnosifufn akdhbtkosi dishhskfi suwuhfkkoah sjjdhhduinkahs Kathryn iSight my jsbsvni Sindhis jahsusi",
      "timestamp": "2022-05-04T15:55:00",
      "order": 57,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 863,
      "text": "It\u2019s windy AF outside this weekend which means no one wants to go to the bar . So it\u2019s been a very slow weekend , not making alot of money so it\u2019s been rough and I\u2019m frustrated . It\u2019s super annoying when the weather/something you can\u2019t control effects your ability to make money so much",
      "timestamp": "2022-05-08T15:03:00",
      "order": 58,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 864,
      "text": "It\u2019s my Friday , so I\u2019m excited about that . But also very tired after a long and boring weekend at work . Hope that business will pick up soon . Would like to make some money and plan some trips for this summer !",
      "timestamp": "2022-05-09T15:23:00",
      "order": 59,
      "valence": -1.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 865,
      "text": "Feeling sluggish and tired today . It\u2019s my weekend but I\u2019m exhausted from work and just want to relax with the dogs . Blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah",
      "timestamp": "2022-05-10T16:13:00",
      "order": 60,
      "valence": -1.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 3,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 866,
      "text": "Annoyed with today . Feeling like I get taken advantage of . I always put aside what I want to do so that I can spend time with my boyfriend and his son but they will never reciprocate and do what i want to do . So in order to do stuff that interests me i always have to do it alone .",
      "timestamp": "2022-05-10T20:20:00",
